-- Prop 3.3: balance writes nothing, and deposit does not write the credit
-- that balance reads, so the two orders have the same meaning. Two
-- deposits both read and write pos (the claim index), thus they are not
-- independent in this version (D69). Their writes to the ledger and to
-- the spent set commute.
p33BalDep : Eq (T natCMon (St natCMon)) (semEscrow (fmCons (Op natCMon) (opBalance natCMon (address 2)) (depOp 1 2 receiptEx (fmNil (Op natCMon)))) s0) (semEscrow (depOp 1 2 receiptEx (fmCons (Op natCMon) (opBalance natCMon (address 2)) (fmNil (Op natCMon)))) s0)
